## Weekly Process

**Monday: Prospecting**
- Run competitor backlink analysis
- Identify 50 new opportunities
- Add to outreach list

**Tuesday-Thursday: Outreach**
- Personalize 20 emails/day
- Send in batches
- Log in tracking sheet

**Friday: Follow-up**
- Follow up on non-responses (7+ days old)
- Track new links acquired
- Review metrics

**Monthly: Analysis**
- Total new referring domains
- DR distribution of new links
- Keyword ranking changes
- Refine strategy
